    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s simple! <strong>Throw with the right amount of power</strong> to sink the shot, then move to the next hoop\u2019s position. Scoring increases the multiplier until the next missed shot, resetting the multiplier to 1.\u00a0<strong>Miss a shot, lose a ball\u2014lose them all, and it\u2019s game over!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Basketballs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basketball skins are given every 3 hours of gameplay straight into your Steam Inventory. The skin is randomly selected from a loot pool.</p>",
